  3.959912241436904*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"52f0362b-93c0-4d5f-800d-\
3f77761312d2"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook solves the relevant equations to obtain the TLN-TDN relations. \
To achieve this, one first solves the TOV equations to model the background \
condition. One then solves the perturbation given by equation (29)-(32) in \
the overleaf document.\
\>", "Text",
